      <version name="0.2.0" author="PurpBatBoi" time="2026-09-19T00:00:00Z">
        <changelog><![CDATA[PAGER launcher: one action opens the suite.
- The launcher is now the only action; the tools are internal files.
- Effects Editor previews on the hardware as you edit and writes to the
  MIDI take only when an Insert button asks for it.
- Shared font and theme across every PAGER window.
- Tool values are restored for the rest of the REAPER session, separately
  per project tab.]]></changelog>
